# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
Chinese ink wash painting, sumi-e style. A tall clear glass bottle of cold-brewed tea resting on a wooden table, the liquid a pale cool green, with whole tea leaves slowly unfurling and suspended throughout the water. A few beads of condensation on the glass. Beside it a short drinking glass holding the same pale green tea. Soft monochrome ink with a faint cool green tint in the liquor, wet brush washes, generous negative space, calm and refreshing. No text, no lettering.
